(text "ECNG 4504 - Phase 0 hardware connections (Arduino Mega 2560, L298N, 5-channel line sensor, 4 DC motors, battery)" (at 40.64 40.64 0) (effects (font (size 2.0 2.0)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c8a615b4-58bc-4401-87b4-61be47cfb4c9))
(text "Pins match maze code: ENA=D5, IN1=D22, IN2=D23, IN3=D24, IN4=D25, ENB=D6, sensors OUT1-OUT5 = D30-D34." (at 40.64 48.26 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 62eaee84-3a6f-4576-820b-7712ca2ae347))
(text "Nets with the same name are connected (labels). M1+M2 are in parallel on L298N OUT1/OUT2, M3+M4 on OUT3/OUT4." (at 40.64 53.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 0fb2434c-11c5-4eba-93a6-1d674aac711e))
(text "CONFIRM ON THE REAL CAR: which motor side is A/B, how the Arduino is powered (VIN / barrel jack / USB)," (at 40.64 172.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1a4428f8-47b7-449c-b083-f0367e96eae4))
(text "and the L298N 5V-regulator jumper. Do not join the L298N 5V output to the Arduino 5V pin while the Arduino is also powered externally." (at 40.64 177.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 6d450133-a8c7-409b-9dc2-33ef6f883bc8))
(text "Sensor polarity in the final code: black line reads LOW." (at 40.64 182.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 202a3ec2-dc23-4479-90d9-765f2b50e83a))
